    <InitialExpressionRight>k__BackingField: 1
    <ActiveSpeaker>k__BackingField: 2
    <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: Hub Gal
    <SpeechText>k__BackingField: It's rare to see that the<color=yellow> Training
